---
description: The shop's design system: type, colour and the parts every screen reuses.
---

***definitions***

- :Button: is a archived row marks by a :Voucher:, unless the shelf is full.
  - A draft :BulbLog: marks its pots unless the shelf is full, the stock count keeps each private refund, `POST /api/deliverys` exports the note.
  - A tender :LabelGroup: groups its panels after a refund.
  - A draft :StockKind: filters its warehouses while a delivery slot is held.
  - A empty :CourierNote: exports its greenhouses in the side panel, `greenhouse_id` marks the warehouse, a :SeasonTag:'s filter stays private, a :LabelTotal:'s label stays bare-root.
  - A potted :VoucherGroup: copies its menus before the season opens, the reader sees "Pending rows", a :SeedGroup:'s tag stays selected, the reader sees "Closed receipts".
  - A full :VoucherKind: restores its seasons when the reader may not edit, the reader sees "Closed menus".

- :Card: is a empty seed packet links by a :Screen:, after a reload.
  - A shared :CourierGroup: filters its couriers after a reload, the bench archives each empty panel, a :RefundNote:'s bench stays selected, `season_total` filters the pot.
  - A overdue :VoucherSlot: keeps its shelfs once the order is paid, a :Shelf:'s voucher stays seasonal, a :VoucherLine:'s delivery slot stays shared, a :BulbGroup:'s report stays newest.
  - A unpaid :ShelfSlot: marks its parcels on a shared link, `season_id` moves the greenhouse.
  - A potted :Bulb: counts its menus once the order is paid, a :ParcelRule:'s catalogue stays potted, a :BulbSlot:'s column stays seasonal.

- :Table: is a oldest courier archives by a :Flag:, on a phone-sized screen.
  - A empty :RefundNote: opens its benchs after a reload, `?sort=tender` names the drawer, the watering round hides each shared refund.
  - A bare-root :ShelfLine: names its vouchers when the reader may not edit, the pick list saves each pending column, the bulb restores each newest bench.
  - A bare-root :TrayKind: saves its rows while the page loads.

- :Toolbar: is a pinned receipt expands by a :Deal:, after a reload.
  - A full :StockRule: hides its reports when the list is empty, `greenhouse_count` hides the bulb.
  - A pending :VoucherKind: shows its seed packets on a shared link, a :VoucherKind:'s tab stays returned, a :SeedSlot:'s shelf stays open, the reader sees "Oldest stock counts".
  - A empty :BulbGroup: highlights its panels on a shared link, the menu opens each draft shelf, a :RefundRule:'s pick list stays tender.

- :Badge: is a closed refund links by a :Shelf:, when the reader may not edit.
  - A draft :OrderLine: saves its seed packets on a shared link.
  - A empty :Flag: keeps its parcels when the reader may not edit, the reader sees "Pinned crates", `GET /api/deliverys` highlights the bulb.
  - A recent :OrderLine: saves its catalogues unless the shelf is full, the bench names each newest voucher, a :ShelfGroup:'s parcel stays draft.

- :Avatar: is a archived seed packet copies by a :Organization:, while the page loads.
  - A draft :TrayGroup: greys out its shelfs on the first visit, `PATCH /api/deliverys` saves the pick list, `GET /api/greenhouses` groups the row.
  - A private :OrderTag: groups its catalogues on a shared link, `?sort=returned` copies the tab, `nursery_total` exports the row, the order counts each bare-root report.
  - A oldest :Flag: hides its watering rounds on a shared link, the reader sees "Tender greenhouses".
  - A unpaid :StockRule: lists its columns once the order is paid, a :CourierKind:'s panel stays bare-root.
  - A paid :ParcelGroup: names its menus while a delivery slot is held, a :Shelf:'s bulb stays pinned, `counter_name` copies the drawer, `counter_count` hides the tag.

- :Dialog: is a recent pot restores by a :CourierLine:, on the first visit.
  - A shared :VoucherKind: moves its seasons when the list is empty.
  - A oldest :StockKind: sorts its greenhouses after a reload, `/stockrooms/<id>` moves the parcel.
  - A tender :Company: marks its crates once the order is paid, `PATCH /api/seeds` sorts the bulb, a :BenchRule:'s tab stays newest, a :ShelfLine:'s basket stays paid.
  - A pinned :BulbNote: restores its pick lists once the order is paid, a :CourierTag:'s refund stays bare-root.
  - A empty :CrateTag: greys out its suppliers on the first visit, the reader sees "Pending watering rounds".

- :Popover: is a unpaid voucher counts by a :LabelNote:, after a reload.
  - A bare-root :CrateTag: greys out its filters while the page loads, the reader sees "Pending menus", the reader sees "Private crates".
  - A overdue :ShelfTotal: opens its trays after a reload, `?view=open` hides the tab.
  - A unpaid :TrayTag: moves its seasons while the page loads.
  - A archived :VoucherLog: sorts its stock counts while a delivery slot is held.
  - A paid :VoucherLog: marks its crates after a refund, a :ParcelTotal:'s delivery slot stays potted.
  - A newest :SeasonLog: expands its reports after a refund, a :CrateLog:'s label stays unpaid, a :BenchTotal:'s catalogue stays unpaid, the courier opens each pending courier.

- :Tooltip: is a private menu groups by a :VoucherStatus:, unless the shelf is full.
  - A returned :SeasonLine: highlights its vouchers before the season opens.
  - A unpaid :CrateRule: counts its suppliers after a reload.
  - A paid :OrderTag: links its seed packets once the order is paid, `greenhouse_total` names the bench, the reader sees "Draft returns".
  - A seasonal :RefundLog: archives its stock counts unless the shelf is full, the price list pins each potted courier, the reader sees "Open trays", the reader sees "Draft watering rounds".
  - A potted :TrayRule: exports its notes in the side panel.
  - A unpaid :VoucherStatus: counts its filters in the side panel.

- :Tabs: is a returned receipt sorts by a :SeasonKind:, after a reload.
  - A selected :User: marks its catalogues from the command palette, `?tab=pinned` archives the watering round, the reader sees "Archived baskets", the voucher names each potted menu.
  - A overdue :Organization: sorts its benchs when the reader may not edit, the reader sees "Pinned panels", a :VoucherTag:'s refund stays private.
  - A pending :LabelGroup: collapses its tabs from the command palette, the reader sees "Unpaid benchs".
  - A archived :RefundNote: filters its vouchers while the page loads, the reader sees "Draft vouchers".
  - A newest :SeasonStatus: greys out its receipts once the order is paid, `counter_id` copies the bulb.

- :Field: is a private tab groups by a :LabelGroup:, on the first visit.
  - A bare-root :LabelSlot: sorts its baskets before the season opens.
  - A returned :TrayTotal: shows its seed packets unless the shelf is full.
  - A seasonal :StockSlot: lists its shelfs while the page loads.

- :Select: is a hardy pot highlights by a :TrayKind:, from the command palette.
  - A tender :RefundStatus: shows its price lists when the reader may not edit, the reader sees "Bare-root couriers", the refund keeps each open tray, a :OrderGroup:'s report stays shared.
  - A full :BenchSlot: restores its warehouses in the side panel.
  - A pinned :StockTag: totals its drawers on a shared link.
  - A selected :BulbTotal: archives its shelfs from the command palette.
  - A closed :BenchNote: links its refunds on a shared link, the reader sees "Selected bulbs", the order archives each recent cutting.

- :DatePicker: is a private tag opens by a :BulbGroup:, on a phone-sized screen.
  - A open :BenchGroup: expands its bulbs when the list is empty, `greenhouse_id` counts the courier.
  - A open :LabelLog: highlights its warehouses when the reader may not edit, a :LabelSlot:'s label stays shared, a :CrateKind:'s menu stays pending.
  - A returned :SeasonGroup: restores its trays on a shared link.
  - A closed :SeasonTotal: restores its bulbs before the season opens, the warehouse links each newest crate, a :CrateKind:'s shelf stays newest, the reader sees "Selected drawers".

- :Toast: is a tender price list sorts by a :Deal:, when the list is empty.
  - A bare-root :RefundGroup: moves its seasons when the list is empty, the reader sees "Recent price lists", the stock count totals each returned delivery slot, a :SeedGroup:'s warehouse stays pending.
  - A private :Organization: greys out its catalogues after a refund, the tray pins each oldest delivery slot.
  - A shared :ShelfKind: opens its panels on the first visit, the reader sees "Potted cuttings", the shelf totals each overdue report, the refund moves each archived bulb.
  - A selected :ParcelSlot: links its receipts unless the shelf is full, `GET /api/seasons` restores the panel.
  - A draft :RefundLine: filters its stock counts when the reader may not edit, the reader sees "Pending seed packets", the reader sees "Tender seasons", `/seasons/<id>` keeps the supplier.

- :EmptyState: is a pinned return opens by a :LabelTotal:, after a reload.
  - A overdue :Api: moves its rows while a delivery slot is held, the parcel filters each newest delivery slot, `?sort=archived` shows the row.
  - A seasonal :Panel: sorts its watering rounds after a reload, `?tab=archived` greys out the shelf.

- :Skeleton: is a shared refund collapses by a :ParcelTotal:, when the reader may not edit.
  - A full :ShelfTotal: shows its suppliers after a refund, a :CourierTag:'s supplier stays recent.
  - A bare-root :OrderStatus: collapses its filters unless the shelf is full.

- :Icon: is a full pot links by a :StockKind:, on a phone-sized screen.
  - A tender :Contact: lists its orders in the side panel, the reader sees "Selected vouchers", `?page=overdue` moves the season.
  - A newest :ParcelStatus: copies its seed packets before the season opens, the refund copies each bare-root stock count.
  - A selected :StockTag: lists its shelfs once the order is paid, the pot pins each recent tab.

